  "duration_s": 493.47,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道中国有多少人放着国外高出几百倍的薪水，不要回国钻深山，求人求了十几年，就为了给国家造一件大国重器吗？不是一个人是一群人。今天讲的这个人，他叫南仁东，他造的重器叫中国天眼。像他这样的人，一共四十位覆盖三十三个学科领域，都写在一本书里，国之脊梁，中国院士的科学人生，百年中国科学院学部科学人生。百年项目组编的四十个院士，四十个把命交给国家的故事，每一个都能让你心口发烫。每一集我们讲一九九三年南仁东在东京撂下一句话，我们也见一个这句话说出来，只要两秒钟，可为了兑现他这个男人在贵州的大山里求人求了十一年。今天这一集咱们就讲讲天眼最苦的那十一年。一九九四年，四十九岁的南仁东辞掉日本的高薪工作，回到祖国。他做的第一件事儿不是画图纸，不是开会，而是选址。你可能觉得找个地方见望远镜有什么难的，难真的难。五百米的大锅不是随便找个坑就能放它得远离城市。方圆几公里不能有电磁干扰，他得是一个天然的洼地，能兜住五百米的直径，地质的稳，岩层得硬，还得干燥少语，没干扰，一个条件都不能少差一个，整个工程就白干了，怎么办？爬山，一座一座的爬南仁东，带着团队把贵州、云南、广西的山翻了个遍，三百多座山头一百多个洼地，一个一个看，一个一个比对。我给你描述一下那个画面，没有路，拄着拐杖走，没有饭，背上干粮走，天黑了，就在山沟里凑合一宿。一个世界级的科学家活成了深山里的老行者。有同事回忆，南老看洼地的时候，不像总工程师像个地质队的老工人，一身旧衣服，鞋上全是泥，蹲在坑边，一看就是大半天，嘴里念叨着地形排水岩层，他看中的那个坑叫大窝囊。嗯，在贵州平塘，当时那个地方没水没电，没路，连当地人都觉得是块荒废之地。可就因为南仁东一句这儿行这块废地，后来成了全世界的焦点。他自己说过一句话，别人都有自己的大设备，我们没有我挺想试一试。这句话他念叨了十一年选址南还不是最难的，最难的是什么？是没人信你。从一九九四年到二零零五年整整十一年，南仁东干的最多的一件事就是求人，求上级批经费，求专家来参与，求各个部门支持。他逢人就讲大赦殿，讲的，口干舌燥，讲的，有些人一见他来，就想躲他自己。后来开玩笑说那几年，我把全世界的马屁都拍了一遍。你听听这句话，一个搞科研的，硬生生把自己逼成了推销员。他心里清楚，光有技术不行，你得先让所有人相信中国能建成这个东西，可人家凭什么信你一个连大型的望远镜都没造过的国家？那几年国际上什么态度？二零零六年，fast项目召开国际评估会，评审专家研究了一圈结论，技术上可行，但是国际上不支持。有些国家更直白的说，这么大的项目放在中国，我们信不过，你看难的不是技术，是偏见。南仁宗没有退路。他说，既然国际上不支持，那我们就自己干，自己干意味着什么经费自己愁，技术自己工所有，难题自己扛，他早就把命。都压上去了，你可能觉得这个人怎么这么硬，他真的一点都不怕吗？来，我给你讲一个画面。一天深夜，南仁东一个人在办公室里哭了，一个六十多岁内心硬的像铁的老爷子，压低声音，哭的肩膀发抖。经费的压力，技术的压力，无数人的期望全压在他一个人身上上，他也有扛不住的时候。可第二天，他照常出现在办公室，照常笑呵呵的跟人打招呼，没人知道前一晚发生了什么。你以为只有精神的压力，还有身体上的那十一年？为了省钱，他出差跟人挤一张床。有一次屁股上长了个大疖子，疼的走路都变了形，他硬挺着不去，医院怕耽误时间，最后接着破了血，顺着腿流到地板上，同时才发现硬把他拖进了医院。同时红着眼眶问他，南老你就不能对自己好一点吗？他说时间不够用啊，二零零七年fast正式立项，二零一一年三月开工嗯，二零一三年十二月五百米的圈粮合龙，二零一四年六座百米高的溃圆塔立了起来。二零一五年，天眼的索网胜利合拢，那张王是全世界精度最高、跨度最大的索网结构。到了这个时候，当年那句被当成笑话的，我们也见一个已经快要变成现实了。工地上的人越来越多天眼的样子，一天比一天清晰起来。可所有人不知道的是，命运正在最后一程，跟他开一个天大的玩笑。二零一五年，天眼工程进入最关键的攻坚期，也就在这一年，南仁东被查出肺癌晚期。消息传开，那天，工地上安静了，很久没人敢相信他，自己的身体，他最清楚，可他没有停。他是怎么撑过最后两年的？可为什么医生都想不通一个病成那样的人还能天天泡在工地上？点个关注下一集。我讲男老生命里最后那段时光，如果你也被这个求了十一年人的老爷子触动到了点赞、收藏、转发，让更多人知道天眼的背后，有一个在山里求了十一年的人，连医院都不敢去的老头。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 5610,
      "text": "你知道中国有多少人放着国外高出几百倍的薪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5710,
      "end_ms": 7950,
      "text": "不要回国钻深山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8590,
      "end_ms": 10390,
      "text": "求人求了十几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10650,
      "end_ms": 13930,
      "text": "就为了给国家造一件大国重器吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14270,
      "end_ms": 16790,
      "text": "不是一个人是一群人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17590,
      "end_ms": 18950,
      "text": "今天讲的这个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19130,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "他叫南仁东，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20630,
      "end_ms": 23610,
      "text": "他造的重器叫中国天眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24450,
      "end_ms": 25590,
      "text": "像他这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26010,
      "end_ms": 29755,
      "text": "一共四十位覆盖三十三个学科领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30310,
      "end_ms": 31730,
      "text": "都写在一本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31730,
      "end_ms": 32530,
      "text": "国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32570,
      "end_ms": 34870,
      "text": "中国院士的科学人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34890,
      "end_ms": 37970,
      "text": "百年中国科学院学部科学人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38030,
      "end_ms": 41270,
      "text": "百年项目组编的四十个院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41710,
      "end_ms": 44370,
      "text": "四十个把命交给国家的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44990,
      "end_ms": 47790,
      "text": "每一个都能让你心口发烫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48530,
      "end_ms": 53530,
      "text": "每一集我们讲一九九三年南仁东在东京撂下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53730,
      "end_ms": 56830,
      "text": "我们也见一个这句话说出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57070,
      "end_ms": 58650,
      "text": "只要两秒钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00021",
      "start_ms": 58650,
      "end_ms": 66195,
      "text": "可为了兑现他这个男人在贵州的大山里求人求了十一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00022",
      "start_ms": 66710,
      "end_ms": 72780,
      "text": "今天这一集咱们就讲讲天眼最苦的那十一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73020,
      "end_ms": 74020,
      "text": "一九九四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74060,
      "end_ms": 78420,
      "text": "四十九岁的南仁东辞掉日本的高薪工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00025",
      "start_ms": 78720,
      "end_ms": 79715,
      "text": "回到祖国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00026",
      "start_ms": 80310,
      "end_ms": 83135,
      "text": "他做的第一件事儿不是画图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00027",
      "start_ms": 83500,
      "end_ms": 84340,
      "text": "不是开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84640,
      "end_ms": 85705,
      "text": "而是选址。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86200,
      "end_ms": 90435,
      "text": "你可能觉得找个地方见望远镜有什么难的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00030",
      "start_ms": 91060,
      "end_ms": 91865,
      "text": "难真的难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00031",
      "start_ms": 92230,
      "end_ms": 97290,
      "text": "五百米的大锅不是随便找个坑就能放它得远离城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00032",
      "start_ms": 97570,
      "end_ms": 99915,
      "text": "方圆几公里不能有电磁干扰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00033",
      "start_ms": 100380,
      "end_ms": 102705,
      "text": "他得是一个天然的洼地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00034",
      "start_ms": 103110,
      "end_ms": 105285,
      "text": "能兜住五百米的直径，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00035",
      "start_ms": 105660,
      "end_ms": 106360,
      "text": "地质的稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106460,
      "end_ms": 107480,
      "text": "岩层得硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107760,
      "end_ms": 109800,
      "text": "还得干燥少语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109900,
      "end_ms": 110655,
      "text": "没干扰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00039",
      "start_ms": 111350,
      "end_ms": 114575,
      "text": "一个条件都不能少差一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00040",
      "start_ms": 115350,
      "end_ms": 117125,
      "text": "整个工程就白干了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00041",
      "start_ms": 118230,
      "end_ms": 118795,
      "text": "怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00042",
      "start_ms": 119130,
      "end_ms": 119705,
      "text": "爬山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120780,
      "end_ms": 124430,
      "text": "一座一座的爬南仁东，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124430,
      "end_ms": 129815,
      "text": "带着团队把贵州、云南、广西的山翻了个遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00045",
      "start_ms": 130400,
      "end_ms": 132960,
      "text": "三百多座山头一百多个洼地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00046",
      "start_ms": 133120,
      "end_ms": 134020,
      "text": "一个一个看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00047",
      "start_ms": 134220,
      "end_ms": 135285,
      "text": "一个一个比对。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136380,
      "end_ms": 138495,
      "text": "我给你描述一下那个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00049",
      "start_ms": 138940,
      "end_ms": 139545,
      "text": "没有路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00050",
      "start_ms": 140710,
      "end_ms": 141830,
      "text": "拄着拐杖走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141930,
      "end_ms": 142550,
      "text": "没有饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00052",
      "start_ms": 142770,
      "end_ms": 143890,
      "text": "背上干粮走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00053",
      "start_ms": 143990,
      "end_ms": 144785,
      "text": "天黑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00054",
      "start_ms": 145150,
      "end_ms": 147005,
      "text": "就在山沟里凑合一宿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00055",
      "start_ms": 147680,
      "end_ms": 151955,
      "text": "一个世界级的科学家活成了深山里的老行者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 153965,
      "text": "有同事回忆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00057",
      "start_ms": 154390,
      "end_ms": 156265,
      "text": "南老看洼地的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00058",
      "start_ms": 157610,
      "end_ms": 161195,
      "text": "不像总工程师像个地质队的老工人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00059",
      "start_ms": 161710,
      "end_ms": 162870,
      "text": "一身旧衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163090,
      "end_ms": 164325,
      "text": "鞋上全是泥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00061",
      "start_ms": 164780,
      "end_ms": 165600,
      "text": "蹲在坑边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00062",
      "start_ms": 165600,
      "end_ms": 167035,
      "text": "一看就是大半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00063",
      "start_ms": 167840,
      "end_ms": 171205,
      "text": "嘴里念叨着地形排水岩层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00064",
      "start_ms": 171560,
      "end_ms": 174645,
      "text": "他看中的那个坑叫大窝囊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174870,
      "end_ms": 175120,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00066",
      "start_ms": 175740,
      "end_ms": 177525,
      "text": "在贵州平塘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00067",
      "start_ms": 178540,
      "end_ms": 183080,
      "text": "当时那个地方没水没电，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183200,
      "end_ms": 183815,
      "text": "没路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184270,
      "end_ms": 186705,
      "text": "连当地人都觉得是块荒废之地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00070",
      "start_ms": 187330,
      "end_ms": 191535,
      "text": "可就因为南仁东一句这儿行这块废地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00071",
      "start_ms": 191870,
      "end_ms": 193795,
      "text": "后来成了全世界的焦点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00072",
      "start_ms": 194470,
      "end_ms": 196025,
      "text": "他自己说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00073",
      "start_ms": 196530,
      "end_ms": 198885,
      "text": "别人都有自己的大设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00074",
      "start_ms": 199480,
      "end_ms": 201885,
      "text": "我们没有我挺想试一试。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00075",
      "start_ms": 202880,
      "end_ms": 207525,
      "text": "这句话他念叨了十一年选址南还不是最难的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00076",
      "start_ms": 208180,
      "end_ms": 209100,
      "text": "最难的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00077",
      "start_ms": 209100,
      "end_ms": 210300,
      "text": "是没人信你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00078",
      "start_ms": 211200,
      "end_ms": 215295,
      "text": "从一九九四年到二零零五年整整十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00079",
      "start_ms": 215740,
      "end_ms": 219225,
      "text": "南仁东干的最多的一件事就是求人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00080",
      "start_ms": 219840,
      "end_ms": 221535,
      "text": "求上级批经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00081",
      "start_ms": 221840,
      "end_ms": 223280,
      "text": "求专家来参与，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00082",
      "start_ms": 223560,
      "end_ms": 225245,
      "text": "求各个部门支持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00083",
      "start_ms": 226070,
      "end_ms": 227765,
      "text": "他逢人就讲大赦殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00084",
      "start_ms": 228160,
      "end_ms": 228540,
      "text": "讲的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00085",
      "start_ms": 228540,
      "end_ms": 229505,
      "text": "口干舌燥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00086",
      "start_ms": 229990,
      "end_ms": 230410,
      "text": "讲的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00087",
      "start_ms": 230410,
      "end_ms": 231790,
      "text": "有些人一见他来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00088",
      "start_ms": 231790,
      "end_ms": 233370,
      "text": "就想躲他自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00089",
      "start_ms": 233370,
      "end_ms": 235485,
      "text": "后来开玩笑说那几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00090",
      "start_ms": 235900,
      "end_ms": 238255,
      "text": "我把全世界的马屁都拍了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00091",
      "start_ms": 238780,
      "end_ms": 239965,
      "text": "你听听这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00092",
      "start_ms": 240400,
      "end_ms": 241845,
      "text": "一个搞科研的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00093",
      "start_ms": 242340,
      "end_ms": 245015,
      "text": "硬生生把自己逼成了推销员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00094",
      "start_ms": 245460,
      "end_ms": 246525,
      "text": "他心里清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00095",
      "start_ms": 246870,
      "end_ms": 248085,
      "text": "光有技术不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00096",
      "start_ms": 248680,
      "end_ms": 253020,
      "text": "你得先让所有人相信中国能建成这个东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00097",
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 258435,
      "text": "可人家凭什么信你一个连大型的望远镜都没造过的国家？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00098",
      "start_ms": 258910,
      "end_ms": 261135,
      "text": "那几年国际上什么态度？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00099",
      "start_ms": 261650,
      "end_ms": 262645,
      "text": "二零零六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00100",
      "start_ms": 263070,
      "end_ms": 265685,
      "text": "fast项目召开国际评估会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00101",
      "start_ms": 266060,
      "end_ms": 268740,
      "text": "评审专家研究了一圈结论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00102",
      "start_ms": 268960,
      "end_ms": 270745,
      "text": "技术上可行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00103",
      "start_ms": 271560,
      "end_ms": 273045,
      "text": "但是国际上不支持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00104",
      "start_ms": 273510,
      "end_ms": 275370,
      "text": "有些国家更直白的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00105",
      "start_ms": 275670,
      "end_ms": 277430,
      "text": "这么大的项目放在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00106",
      "start_ms": 277650,
      "end_ms": 278835,
      "text": "我们信不过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00107",
      "start_ms": 279300,
      "end_ms": 281140,
      "text": "你看难的不是技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00108",
      "start_ms": 281360,
      "end_ms": 282195,
      "text": "是偏见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00109",
      "start_ms": 282700,
      "end_ms": 283940,
      "text": "南仁宗没有退路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00110",
      "start_ms": 284100,
      "end_ms": 284520,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00111",
      "start_ms": 284820,
      "end_ms": 286540,
      "text": "既然国际上不支持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00112",
      "start_ms": 286680,
      "end_ms": 287835,
      "text": "那我们就自己干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00113",
      "start_ms": 288860,
      "end_ms": 293635,
      "text": "自己干意味着什么经费自己愁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00114",
      "start_ms": 293980,
      "end_ms": 296330,
      "text": "技术自己工所有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00115",
      "start_ms": 296330,
      "end_ms": 297615,
      "text": "难题自己扛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00116",
      "start_ms": 298470,
      "end_ms": 299605,
      "text": "他早就把命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00117",
      "start_ms": 301180,
      "end_ms": 302175,
      "text": "都压上去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00118",
      "start_ms": 304180,
      "end_ms": 307100,
      "text": "你可能觉得这个人怎么这么硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00119",
      "start_ms": 307500,
      "end_ms": 309440,
      "text": "他真的一点都不怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00120",
      "start_ms": 310500,
      "end_ms": 310740,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00121",
      "start_ms": 310900,
      "end_ms": 312240,
      "text": "我给你讲一个画面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00122",
      "start_ms": 313380,
      "end_ms": 314340,
      "text": "一天深夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00123",
      "start_ms": 315220,
      "end_ms": 319500,
      "text": "南仁东一个人在办公室里哭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00124",
      "start_ms": 320720,
      "end_ms": 325180,
      "text": "一个六十多岁内心硬的像铁的老爷子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00125",
      "start_ms": 325400,
      "end_ms": 326320,
      "text": "压低声音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00126",
      "start_ms": 326620,
      "end_ms": 328060,
      "text": "哭的肩膀发抖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00127",
      "start_ms": 328520,
      "end_ms": 329600,
      "text": "经费的压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00128",
      "start_ms": 329860,
      "end_ms": 330860,
      "text": "技术的压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00129",
      "start_ms": 330880,
      "end_ms": 334250,
      "text": "无数人的期望全压在他一个人身上上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00130",
      "start_ms": 334530,
      "end_ms": 336210,
      "text": "他也有扛不住的时候。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00131",
      "start_ms": 336650,
      "end_ms": 337530,
      "text": "可第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00132",
      "start_ms": 337770,
      "end_ms": 339630,
      "text": "他照常出现在办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00133",
      "start_ms": 340010,
      "end_ms": 342070,
      "text": "照常笑呵呵的跟人打招呼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00134",
      "start_ms": 342670,
      "end_ms": 345490,
      "text": "没人知道前一晚发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00135",
      "start_ms": 345730,
      "end_ms": 347990,
      "text": "你以为只有精神的压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00136",
      "start_ms": 348310,
      "end_ms": 350750,
      "text": "还有身体上的那十一年？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00137",
      "start_ms": 351110,
      "end_ms": 351950,
      "text": "为了省钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00138",
      "start_ms": 352230,
      "end_ms": 353910,
      "text": "他出差跟人挤一张床。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00139",
      "start_ms": 354750,
      "end_ms": 357570,
      "text": "有一次屁股上长了个大疖子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00140",
      "start_ms": 357830,
      "end_ms": 359665,
      "text": "疼的走路都变了形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00141",
      "start_ms": 360200,
      "end_ms": 361440,
      "text": "他硬挺着不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361460,
      "end_ms": 362895,
      "text": "医院怕耽误时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00143",
      "start_ms": 364320,
      "end_ms": 366930,
      "text": "最后接着破了血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00144",
      "start_ms": 366970,
      "end_ms": 368855,
      "text": "顺着腿流到地板上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00145",
      "start_ms": 369490,
      "end_ms": 372945,
      "text": "同时才发现硬把他拖进了医院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00146",
      "start_ms": 373910,
      "end_ms": 375645,
      "text": "同时红着眼眶问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00147",
      "start_ms": 376650,
      "end_ms": 380095,
      "text": "南老你就不能对自己好一点吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00148",
      "start_ms": 380510,
      "end_ms": 382625,
      "text": "他说时间不够用啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00149",
      "start_ms": 383700,
      "end_ms": 386455,
      "text": "二零零七年fast正式立项，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00150",
      "start_ms": 387250,
      "end_ms": 389870,
      "text": "二零一一年三月开工嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00151",
      "start_ms": 390360,
      "end_ms": 393955,
      "text": "二零一三年十二月五百米的圈粮合龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00152",
      "start_ms": 395760,
      "end_ms": 400530,
      "text": "二零一四年六座百米高的溃圆塔立了起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00153",
      "start_ms": 400610,
      "end_ms": 401650,
      "text": "二零一五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00154",
      "start_ms": 401710,
      "end_ms": 404065,
      "text": "天眼的索网胜利合拢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00155",
      "start_ms": 404790,
      "end_ms": 410525,
      "text": "那张王是全世界精度最高、跨度最大的索网结构。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00156",
      "start_ms": 411240,
      "end_ms": 412405,
      "text": "到了这个时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00157",
      "start_ms": 412890,
      "end_ms": 414890,
      "text": "当年那句被当成笑话的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00158",
      "start_ms": 414890,
      "end_ms": 418575,
      "text": "我们也见一个已经快要变成现实了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00159",
      "start_ms": 419100,
      "end_ms": 422265,
      "text": "工地上的人越来越多天眼的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00160",
      "start_ms": 422570,
      "end_ms": 424755,
      "text": "一天比一天清晰起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00161",
      "start_ms": 425200,
      "end_ms": 426855,
      "text": "可所有人不知道的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00162",
      "start_ms": 427290,
      "end_ms": 429905,
      "text": "命运正在最后一程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00163",
      "start_ms": 430400,
      "end_ms": 432245,
      "text": "跟他开一个天大的玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00164",
      "start_ms": 434470,
      "end_ms": 435470,
      "text": "二零一五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00165",
      "start_ms": 435630,
      "end_ms": 439145,
      "text": "天眼工程进入最关键的攻坚期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00166",
      "start_ms": 440110,
      "end_ms": 441335,
      "text": "也就在这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00167",
      "start_ms": 441940,
      "end_ms": 445715,
      "text": "南仁东被查出肺癌晚期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00168",
      "start_ms": 446440,
      "end_ms": 447400,
      "text": "消息传开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00169",
      "start_ms": 447420,
      "end_ms": 447855,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00170",
      "start_ms": 448690,
      "end_ms": 450150,
      "text": "工地上安静了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00171",
      "start_ms": 450150,
      "end_ms": 454910,
      "text": "很久没人敢相信他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00172",
      "start_ms": 454910,
      "end_ms": 455815,
      "text": "自己的身体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00173",
      "start_ms": 456060,
      "end_ms": 456880,
      "text": "他最清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00174",
      "start_ms": 457100,
      "end_ms": 457975,
      "text": "可他没有停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00175",
      "start_ms": 458960,
      "end_ms": 461355,
      "text": "他是怎么撑过最后两年的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00176",
      "start_ms": 462070,
      "end_ms": 468255,
      "text": "可为什么医生都想不通一个病成那样的人还能天天泡在工地上？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00177",
      "start_ms": 468920,
      "end_ms": 470775,
      "text": "点个关注下一集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00178",
      "start_ms": 471090,
      "end_ms": 474215,
      "text": "我讲男老生命里最后那段时光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00179",
      "start_ms": 475330,
      "end_ms": 481765,
      "text": "如果你也被这个求了十一年人的老爷子触动到了点赞、收藏、转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00180",
      "start_ms": 482920,
      "end_ms": 486105,
      "text": "让更多人知道天眼的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00181",
      "start_ms": 487290,
      "end_ms": 489965,
      "text": "有一个在山里求了十一年的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_333c0b46ef6256fc_s00182",
      "start_ms": 491380,
      "end_ms": 493315,
      "text": "连医院都不敢去的老头。"
    }
  ],
